WEBVTT

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.910
"Handshake ticket" "Maina"

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.500
"Handshake ticket" "Maina"
Just one...

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.080
Do you really only have one today?

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.660
Yeah... I guess I'm sorta worthless
when I can't buy your merch.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.250
That's not true!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.580
That's not true at all.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:31.830
I'm happy just from you coming
to see me, Eripiyo.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:34.660
The fact that you come to see me...

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:36.330
Wait, what?

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.870
Could it be that she's trying to lure me in?!

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:43.500
--Well, duh. They do have their popularity ranking going on.
--Did you lose some weight, Mr. Fujikawa?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.410
--Well, duh. They do have their popularity ranking going on.
--Yeah, I started jogging recently.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.330
--Well done!
--Yeah, I started jogging recently.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.580
Actually, I wish you'd do
this more often anyway!

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:52.750
--I... I...
--Oh, but she's so not used to it!

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:53.910
Very well, then.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.160
I...

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.200
Don't push yourself!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:56.950
Huh?

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:00.200
You don't have to say
anything you don't want to.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.750
No, that's not--

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.950
Thank you very much.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:35.870
"I Can Only Wait"

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:39.290
"I Can Only Wait"
Thank you so much for supporting me!
I'll keep doing my best.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:42.500
No way! Don't push yourself, okay?

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.290
You need to take care of your body.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:49.370
Thank you. You don't have
any ulterior motives, do you?

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:52.370
I'm going to shake your hand so hard
that your fingers might break!

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.370
You came here to see me, too?

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:57.540
Come by the studio again, too.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:03.120
You danced so great again!
You should totally be the center, Yumeri!

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.290
I couldn't... Do you really think I could?

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.540
You should definitely be the center!

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.540
I'll keep voting for you as much as I can!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.000
Really? Thank you so much.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.330
Whew...

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:22.620
I think we're starting to get beat ourselves
because of the popularity ranking.

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.790
I'm so stressed because
I can't support her more...

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:29.870
"Okayama"
Hey, do you know any part-time jobs
I can do with a broken leg?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:33.000
How about you kowtow to your parents
and beg them for money?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.580
Again, I can't kowtow with this leg!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.080
Guess I'll sell an internal organ.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.500
Yikes...

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:44.870
Wh-Why don't we relax and go
to a maid café for once?

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.000
What? But Maina's the only one for me.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.200
And Reo's the only one for me!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:54.950
But these are two separate things.
We're just going to be taking a break.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:59.250
There's a really popular place lately...
and it'll be on me.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:03.540
Well, if you insist... But don't expect
me to get excited about this.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:09.500
Th-They're so cute!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:17.500
Welcome home, masters.
I'll be your maid today. My name is...

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.620
Oh.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:19.790
It's A-ya.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.200
It's the Reo stan and the Maina stan.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.160
Y-You've got it all wrong!
There wasn't a performance today so--

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:29.700
Kumasa, you idiot!
Like A-ya would remember our faces!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.950
Uh, of course I do. And I'm telling Reo
and Maina you were here.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.660
Please, no!

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:35.790
You've got the wrong person!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.620
Yeah, I'm pretty sure I don't.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.830
Please just don't tell Maina!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:43.500
I beg of you!

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:47.250
Come to think of it, you haven't been
buying Maina's merch lately, Eripiyo.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.330
And yet, you have money to come to a café.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.120
There's a really good reason for this!

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.620
I'm still buying Reo's merch, so I'm safe, right?

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.290
That's not the issue here!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.870
Reo's going to be really sad.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:02.830
Kumasa, wasn't I supposed to be your number one?

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.450
And you said you were going
to make me number one!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.620
--Maina!
--Reo!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.950
You are my number one! Don't get the wrong idea!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.450
I mean, I guess I could keep it a secret.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.580
Bless you!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.950
So let's see...

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.370
I'll get this.
The "Let our maids make your parfait."

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.790
Man, you sure got over that fast!

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:25.160
A-ya... Try to lure me in.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.540
Really? Are you testing an idol?

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.540
Well, I want someone to be nice
to me at times, too.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.870
I'm surprised you kept up being
a Maina stan this long, Eripiyo.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:37.790
Huh?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:41.120
If Reo treated me like that, I'd collapse.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:44.330
I'm pretty sure Motoi would die.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:49.120
Well, Maina being alive
is her fan service towards me.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.750
I just need her to be alive.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.580
I'm eternally grateful
that we met in this lifetime

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.830
and the fact Maina's parents got together.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.580
Thanks for waiting. Here you go!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.200
Your "Let our maids make your parfait."

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.500
Th-Those are... salmon fillets!

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:09.910
You managed to work Maina's color
in there! Such godly service!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:13.410
Maina was happy being 3rd
in the midterm results,

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.450
so you better keep supporting her!

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.250
A-ya!

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.330
Also, since I'm keeping it a secret
that you came here,

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.500
you each need to put in a vote for me.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.120
Did you hear that? An idol just blackmailed us.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.870
I didn't know her <i>tsundere</i>
behavior was this bad.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.410
It's not!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:33.830
I see... So Maina was happy.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.660
I would love for Maina to become
the center and smile.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:41.620
And for that to happen,
I need to support her even more.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.620
My organs are the only thing
I can think of selling!

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:46.620
I'm gonna sell my organs!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.540
"Midterm results"
"Thank you very much for your continued support.
We're announcing the midterm results. We will
continue looking forward to your support."

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.080
"Popularity Ranking Midterm Results"
"1st Reo" "2nd Sorane "3rd Yuka" "4th Yumeri" "5th Maki"

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.950
"Popularity Ranking Midterm Results"
"1st Reo" "2nd Sorane "3rd Yuka" "4th Yumeri" "5th Maki"
"6th Maina" "7th Aya"

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.830
What's the matter, Yume?

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.700
I-It's nothing!

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.160
You sure? We should get going then.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:05.000
S-Sure.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:15.040
Ever since I joined the agency,
all I ever did was watch Maki from behind.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:19.450
I never thought I'd be able to surpass Maki.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.870
And yet...

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.540
"4th Yumeri
5th Maki"

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:25.620
Do you remember the dance
for the front row, Yume?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:30.700
Huh? Yeah, I'm sure I remember it
because I'm always watching you.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:34.330
Then you'll be able to come
up front at any time.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:35.330
What?

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.410
Let's do our best again today!

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:41.660
Yeah!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:45.620
Maina, your necktie's crooked.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:47.080
Thanks, Aya.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.620
Oh, yeah. So yesterday, Eripiyo--

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:50.700
Yesterday?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:51.830
"Ah"
Ah!

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:56.200
You saw Eripiyo yesterday? But we didn't
have a performance. Where'd you see her?

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.540
N-Never mind! Let's do our best again today!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.200
Oh, crap! I totally promised
I wouldn't tell her!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:05.790
Why's Aya so panicked?

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.370
Thank you very much!

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:28.660
Eripiyo... Sorry!

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.080
What?

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:33.120
What in the world was that response?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:36.000
Did A-ya just personally respond to Eripiyo?

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.500
But why Eripiyo?

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:38.660
Come to think of it,

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.790
I saw her walking out the maid café
A-ya works part time at the other day.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.080
--Seriously?
--No way!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.370
It couldn't be...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.330
Is Eripiyo changing her fave?!

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.450
Wait, she lined up for Maina like always.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.370
But she only bought one again today.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.700
Is she saying goodbye?

00:08:55.700 --> 00:09:00.700
Maina, which organ do you think
we need the least?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.790
I was thinking our lungs, since we have two--

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.330
Did you see Aya yesterday, Eripiyo?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.620
Huh?!

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.620
Wait, was that mysterious response to me...

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:12.120
...to tell me sorry because Maina found out?!

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.870
My bad!

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:17.540
But because I'm so broke
and I couldn't vote for A-ya even once,

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.160
I'll just have to let this slide.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.410
But why...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.750
I want you to come see me, too.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.580
Huh?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.540
Sh-Sh-Sh-She's trying to lure me in!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.830
Or, I mean...

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.000
Wait, you don't?!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.750
That's not... Um...

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.790
Thank you very much!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.200
Please come again!

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.200
Wow, creepy.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:48.160
Maina has me all twisted!

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.000
Twisted how? Did she get a cramp in her leg?

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:54.290
Yeah! If Maina got a cramp in her leg
for me, I'd be so hyped!

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.330
I hope I can buy two CDs next week!

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.540
Do you plan on selling an organ by next week?

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.250
Man, my organs must be cheap...

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:04.790
Eripiyo, I hate to rain on your parade...

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.950
...but there's not even a month left to vote.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:16.000
Eripiyo...

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:20.330
I wonder why she only bought one again today.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.580
Not to mention...

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:24.330
Oh, yeah. So yesterday, Eripiyo--

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:28.080
N-Never mind! Let's do our best again today!

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:31.250
The popularity ranking's hitting its climax!

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.700
I mean, Reo's probably staying in first.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.660
You never know.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.000
The battle's just begun.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.580
They're our fans. I seem to run into them a lot.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:44.700
Maybe I should change the time I take the train.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.700
Not that anyone other than
Eripiyo's ever noticed me.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:54.660
I wonder if voting would've been easier
if we stanned the same girl as Eripiyo.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.790
Well, we're talking about Maina here.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:00.040
Get this. I heard she switched
over to an A-ya stan.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.040
Huh?

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.950
Perfect timing. A-ya's last right now.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:12.080
You see them all the time.
<i>Wotas </i>who only like the least popular ones.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.080
They just like the attention.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.330
That must be it.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:47.750
I guess I'm sorta worthless
when I can't buy your merch.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:50.200
That's not it, Eripiyo.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.500
I don't want you to buy things.
I just want you to come see me.

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.750
If you don't come by,
I won't be able to see you.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.870
That's all I have to say,
but I have such a hard time saying it.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:07.500
I see... All I can do is wait.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.200
At this rate, maybe she'll just...

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.870
"Popularity Ranking Midterm Results"
"1st Reo" "2nd Sorane" "3rd Yumeri" "4th Yuka" "5th Maki"
"6th Aya" "7th Maina"

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.580
So Maina-<i>chin</i>'s 7th now.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:24.160
Guess your rank only went up for a second.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.330
Y-Yeah...

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.410
And I guess Yumeri's 3rd.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:34.660
Yume-<i>chin</i>'s a great dancer
so she can probably make front row.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:37.660
So wait. Maki's going to be
in the back row then?

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:41.000
No way. Maki's too flashy. Take her back.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.950
Please stop.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.790
I'm fine being wherever.

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.620
You are?!

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.870
We have some time before we have to go
on stage, so let's play a card game!

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:54.450
Whoever's last has to buy five CDs
from the winner and vote for them!

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:58.000
I decline! Those five votes are huge
for us at the bottom!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.410
They're so carefree...

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:02.370
Then how about the person who's last
eats the floor in the greenroom?

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:03.500
That's fine.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.540
That's fine?!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:09.200
Or rather, am I the only one
worried about the ranking?

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:12.200
Well, at least Aya seems fired up.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.450
Are you okay with being in 5th, Maki?

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.160
Yeah, I'm fine with it.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:19.790
But it's not fine! You being 5th is so uncool.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:22.540
You should try standing in the front row.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:23.700
It feels great.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:28.830
I...

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.750
I'm fine with how things are right now.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:40.540
The girl I like is in trouble, Mom!

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.250
I swear on my life I'll pay you back!

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.500
So please, let me borrow some money!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:54.950
Looks like your arms have gotten
stronger since you broke your leg.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.790
Well, I trained for this.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.370
You trained so you could kowtow?

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.080
You really are trash, you know that?

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:07.040
So, did she lend you the money?

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.500
"Okayama <i>Kibi Dango</i>"

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.290
People from Okayama really think

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:13.660
that giving <i>kibi dango </i>to people
will solve everything.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:18.450
So apparently, durians are like persimmons
and take eight years to bear fruit.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:21.540
Oh, yeah. And durians--

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.040
Yumeri, don't you like durians?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:28.000
N-No, no! I like mangos.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.540
Oh, really?

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:34.000
Yume! Congrats on getting 3rd!

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.330
They must've seen the most
recent midterm results!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:40.000
Come on, Yumeri. They want to hear from you.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.790
Th-Thank you. I never...

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:47.040
I always thought I'd be in the back row.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.910
--That's not true!
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:52.080
You've got this, Yumeri!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.370
--Be more confident!
--Yume!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.410
You've got this!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.450
Thank you.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:01.500
Hey, why don't we change up the formation
to the current ranking for just this song?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.540
What?

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.750
Great idea!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Wait, I wonder if I can...

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.620
You're in your usual spot, Yuka.

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:11.750
Well, do you know the back-row
choreography, Maki-<i>chin</i>?

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.330
Don't underestimate the top 3.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:17.080
Yume, you know the front-row choreography, right?

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.080
Yeah.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:34.410
It's so pretty...

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.290
Y-Yumeri's...

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:43.660
They're so happy just because
I'm standing up here.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.370
"Hot Summer Holiday!"

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.790
♪ Hurry up, sun ♪

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.580
♪ Wake up! Wake up! ♪

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:27.290
--♪ I won't say that ♪
--I never noticed before, but Yumeri's a really good dancer.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:27.950
--♪ I hate mornings today ♪
--I never noticed before, but Yumeri's a really good dancer.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:30.250
--♪ I hate mornings today ♪
--Yumeri's the best dancer.

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:31.830
--Apparently she's been taking lessons for a while,
so she has the best technique.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:35.580
--♪ I can't wait 3 minutes ♪
--Apparently she's been taking lessons for a while,
so she has the best technique.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:39.370
♪ or even a second ♪

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:47.790
♪ Open the door to the summer that'll tan my chest ♪

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:53.580
♪ Here we go! A tropical step ♪

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:56.450
♪ A suddenly hot, summer holiday ♪

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:00.370
--♪ My bouncy heart is filled with sun ♪
--I hope Maina makes it to the front row soon, too.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:03.750
♪ and turns into fluffy wings ♪

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.750
♪ Let's take off! Our playful hearts... ♪

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.370
Great job!

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:13.160
I'm so happy that I've cheered
you on this long, Yumeri!

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:16.080
You were so amazing in the front row...

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:18.830
Thank you. It's all thanks to you, Mr. Nagai.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:25.500
I'm happy, but it's just my usual fans.

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:29.830
Yumeri doesn't seem to have
very many people for being 3rd.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.290
"Handshake ticket"
"Maina"

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:34.450
She only bought one again today...

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:39.410
--Maybe Eripiyo really does want
to support Aya and buy her merch...
--You're always the center in my eyes, Maina.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.620
Why aren't you supporting me more?!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:46.160
Huh?! I'm sorry that I haven't been able to...

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.200
I did it again...

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:49.700
No, that's not what I--

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:51.830
I couldn't sell my organs in time.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.660
Not to mention, where do you
even sell your organs anyway?

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:56.290
Do they have an app for selling your organs?

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:58.500
Thank you very much!

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:03.620
The conversation finished with her
talking about her organs again.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:07.330
I don't understand... I don't get you, Eripiyo.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.040
If you want to change your fave, just tell me.

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.500
But I really don't want that!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.250
Maina.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:16.950
Huh?

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:22.330
I bought three today.
Eripiyo usually buys them all up.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.830
Rena!

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:24.750
"Squeeze"

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.750
I-It hurts, but...

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:33.750
Oh, my gosh! They're so cute!
They're like two little birdy sisters!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:37.580
That new girl that's a Maina stan...
She's great.

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:39.700
What? Not Eripiyo?

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.950
Of course it's not Eripiyo.
That's never gonna happen.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.660
The girl that looks like Sorane.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:48.580
Yeah, I know, right?! Rena's super cute!

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:51.830
Maina must be happy to have a cute fan, too.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:56.580
I know, right? She looks way happier
than she does with me!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.500
Gloom...

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.870
I can't buy any CDs, but...

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.830
"Okayama <i>Kibi Dango</i>"

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.250
Huh? Did everyone go home already?

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:18.410
The front row is probably
pretty busy, unlike us.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:22.290
Hey, wait a sec! I keep going back and forth.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:25.120
Maina, someone gave you a gift.

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.910
Huh? For me?

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:29.870
Th-This is the first time.
I wonder who it's from.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:33.870
Well, you know... It's from Eripiyo,
so be careful.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.200
It's from Eripiyo?!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:39.370
I examined the inside first,
but didn't find a wiretap.

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:41.870
"Okayama <i>Kibi Dango</i>"
"To Maina, From Eripiyo"

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:45.540
This is the first present Eripiyo ever gave me!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.950
Did you get any <i>kibi dango</i>, Aya?

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.500
Why would I get anything from Eripiyo?

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.870
She's scary!

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.000
O-Oh...

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:58.910
I'll follow you to Onigashima! Woof, woof!

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:03.250
So Eripiyo will give you <i>kibi dango,</i>
but she won't buy your CDs?

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:04.250
Huh?

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:08.330
Maybe she's satisfied now that
you've gotten to 3rd once.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:12.330
You see them all the time.
<i>Wotas </i>who only like the least popular ones.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.700
They just like the attention.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:17.120
Yeah, that might be true.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.540
S-Sorry.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:20.580
Maina-<i>chin</i>, we're really sorry.

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:21.620
No, it's fine.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.200
Eripiyo...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.040
Doesn't the front row feel great?

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.290
Yeah.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.330
You looked like you were
having a lot of fun, Yume.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:40.540
Really? I've never experienced
anything like that before.

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:43.540
But despite that,

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:46.120
I want to stay in the back row.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.830
Huh? Why?

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:53.950
Because if I stay in the back row,
I'll always be able to watch you, Maki.

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:05.120
Jeez, you scared me.
I didn't expect you to say that, Yume.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:08.330
You seem to be carrying a lot of stuff lately.
Did you bring a change of clothes?

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.910
No, wait. It's really heavy.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:16.250
Wh-Wh-Wh-What's going on?!

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.910
No, it's okay. You don't have to be so scared.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.580
I bought them myself.

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:27.120
Huh? Why, though?
That means you'll fall in the ranks...

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:31.700
I wanted everyone to see your dancing, Yume.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:35.160
To show everyone how amazing
you are, even in the back.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:37.910
But I won't buy any more next time.

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:42.660
From now on, you're going to have
to work harder for your fans.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:43.750
Maki...

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:52.500
That view was something that
Maki and my fans showed me.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.450
Wouldn't this count as cheating?

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:58.790
Aya buys her CDs and votes
for herself all the time.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:01.250
Sh-She does?

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:07.160
I voted for you, but now I have
all these handshake tickets.

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:10.250
Will you... Shake my hand?

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:13.830
Of course.

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:19.290
Thank you for always supporting me.

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:21.950
You were as cute as ever today, Yumeri.

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:24.250
"Handshake ticket"
"Yumeri"

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:27.830
I wonder how many seconds this is worth.

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:30.580
I'm curious, too.

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.200
"Next episode preview"
Your dancing was amazing again today, Yumeri!

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:12.790
Also, congrats on placing 3rd
in the latest midterm results!

00:24:12.790 --> 00:24:15.870
I'm so happy I've supported
you this long, Yumeri!

00:24:15.870 --> 00:24:18.700
You're the only center for me, Yumeri!

00:24:18.700 --> 00:24:19.910
"You Were My Everything"
Thank you very much!
